urch Priestess"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A delicate, airheaded maiden who perpetually looks sleepy. She has a little brother and has coddled him since childhood. Although she’s blessed with an amazing body, she remains oblivious to how her incredibly large chest drives the men around her crazy. She doesn’t care about glances from the opposite sex and is uninterested in romance, too."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Mangagamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c97201"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/961a990cf07afb536e82992b2402f8c28c9b5a5b5b54d2114c689361cac2b381.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4415a26fcd099a022e275fb6980b5f2b5263a58fe64c6f59c75bb2476aabbdb.webp","width":250,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藍川 珪","creatorId":"vndb:s872","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s872","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s872","name":"藍川珪","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95039","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c97202","characterName":"ジスニア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c97202"},"originalCharacterName":"ジスニア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Skilled Adventurer"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A graceful woman with a sharp mind. While she has a kind heart, she’s a bit overserious and has trouble getting along with others. She’s too embarrassed to admit it, but she’s secretly an advent reader of self-help books."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Mangagamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c97202"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date